-2021-01-29#:~:text=Life%2C%20distant%2C%20nevertheless%20had,liquid%20fills%20a%20vessel.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Miguel Lopez"],"date":"2021-01-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=Life%2C%20distant%2C%20nevertheless%20had,liquid%20fills%20a%20vessel.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.\" by Miguel Lopez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Jan 2021."}},{"id":"direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29-e12","summary":"Bjorn reveals he means to climb a tower built by his ancestors and cut open a passage to Starnheim, and orders Ranar to follow.","participants":["egon","ranar-the-ever-watchful"],"location":"istfell","importance":"minor","page":"stories/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","order":407,"story_date":"2021-01-29","storyline":"Kaldheim","source":"wizards","paragraph":96,"quote":"Now I will climb it, and with this sword cut open a passage to Starnheim.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=Now%20I%20will%20climb,a%20passage%20to%20Starnheim.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Miguel Lopez"],"date":"2021-01-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=Now%20I%20will%20climb,a%20passage%20to%20Starnheim.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.\" by Miguel Lopez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Jan 2021."}},{"id":"direction-purpose-ho